    ":question/worked-solution": "Recall the difference formula for sine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡(u-v)=\\operatorname{sin}⁡u\\operatorname{cos}⁡v-\\operatorname{cos}⁡u\\operatorname{sin}⁡v\n$$\n\nApplying the difference formula for sine with $u=x$ and $v=\\frac{\\pi }{2},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-\\frac{\\pi }{2}) & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\left(\\frac{\\pi }{2}\\right)-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\left(\\frac{\\pi }{2}\\right) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\cdot (0)-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\cdot (1) \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$"
