    ":question/worked-solution": "Recall the difference formula for sine:\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡(u-v)=\\operatorname{sin}⁡u\\operatorname{cos}⁡v-\\operatorname{cos}⁡u\\operatorname{sin}⁡v\n$$\n\nApplying the difference formula for sine with $u=x$ and $v=\\frac{5\\pi }{4},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x-\\frac{5\\pi }{4}) & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\left(\\frac{5\\pi }{4}\\right)-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\left(\\frac{5\\pi }{4}\\right) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡x\\cdot \\left(-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right)-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x\\cdot \\left(-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right) \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{2}+\\frac{\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{cos}⁡x}{2} \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\,\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\,\\operatorname{cos}⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$"
